  type: 21
  titleZH: "\u4FE1\u4EF0\u4E4B\u8E8D"
  titleEN: The Leap of Faith
  descriptionZH: "\u4E00\u500B\u795E\u79D8\u6559\u6D3E\u8072\u7A31\u53EA\u8981\u5E7E\u540D\u8239\u54E1\u8DF3\u5165\u6D77\u4E2D\u4FBF\u80FD\u6DE8\u5316\u8239\u9AD4\uFF0C\u4F60\u9078\u64C7\u76F8\u4FE1\u55CE\uFF1F\n\n[\u76F8\u4FE1]
    \u8239\u9AD4 -30 / \u8239\u54E1 -3\n[\u4E0D\u4FE1] \u98DF\u7269 -20 / \u8239\u9AD4
    -5"
  descriptionEN: 'A mysterious cult claims that sending a few crew members overboard
    will "purify" the ship. Do you believe them?


    [Believe] Ship HP -30 / Crew
    -3

    [Refuse] Food -20 / Ship HP -5'
  acceptLabelZH: "\u76F8\u4FE1"
  acceptLabelEN: Believe
  rejectLabelZH: "\u4E0D\u4FE1"
  rejectLabelEN: Refuse
  acceptDelta:
    food: 0
    crew: -3
    shipHP: -30
    navProgress: 0
  rejectDelta:
